\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, I fain would find
\par Thy zeal for God in me,
\par Thy yearning pity for manknid,
\par Thy burning charity.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In me Thy Spirit dwell;
\par In me Thy mercies move:
\par So shall the fervour of my zeal
\par Be the pure flame of love.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

